  "goodToKnow": "Der Schlussstrich is a line drawn under something: einen Schlussstrich ziehen means to end something for good, a relationship, a dispute or a chapter of life. Since the 1996 reform it's written with three s. In German memory politics, the Schlussstrichdebatte concerns calls to stop dwelling on the Nazi past, which most politicians reject: es darf keinen Schlussstrich geben. Plural: die Schlussstriche."
